WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,690 --> 00:00:07,410
Do you know any way to improve attributes?

2
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:09,570
Just give me a unit of resources

3
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:11,050
I tell you the news

4
00:00:11,970 --> 00:00:14,330
Talents can temporarily or permanently improve attributes

5
00:00:14,810 --> 00:00:15,850
I added someone

6
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:18,930
His talent is to gain one free attribute point every day

7
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:20,250
And I also found out

8
00:00:20,410 --> 00:00:22,490
If you could combine strength, agility and intelligence

9
00:00:22,490 --> 00:00:23,490
All raised to five points

10
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:25,290
The physical attributes will appear on the panel.

11
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:29,690
Can greatly improve physical fitness and stamina, brothers

12
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:31,690
Are you asking this because you want to go out and fight?

13
00:00:32,050 --> 00:00:32,970
Be careful

14
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:34,170
There are a lot of monsters out there

15
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:36,810
There are also sinister residents who stab you in the back.

16
00:00:37,090 --> 00:00:38,970
Don’t just trust anyone when forming a team

17
00:00:39,130 --> 00:00:41,570
When the three-dimensional attribute reaches five points, the physical attribute can be unlocked.

18
00:00:42,010 --> 00:00:47,370
It seems that I will have to increase my attribute points when I have the opportunity in the future. As for going out, I’m sorry. I just want to lie down.

19
00:00:50,190 --> 00:00:52,030
Four loaves for two springs
